      {
        "id": 1623059506,
        "content": "I am assuming that this can be done within an 8 hour window, but that it will likely be done over several days in short bursts. That's why I set the time to \"<1 Day\"\r\nI suppose it might be more expressive to rename the `Time` labels to be in hours so that it does not imply over how many days, which is more aligned with how we've been using this system e.g. `Hours: <8`\r\nUnfortunately people tend to conflate a time estimate in hours with an hourly rate, so this could cause issues with how its interpreted, even if the pricing algorithm nets the same amount in the end.",
